# Copy to .env.local for local development.

# --- Server-side secret (never NEXT_PUBLIC) ---
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me
# --- Google reCAPTCHA v3 (invisible spam protection for recording gifts) ---
# Server-side secret. NEVER commit a real value or give it a NEXT_PUBLIC_ name. Set it in .env.local
# locally and as the RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY GitHub secret for production. Without it, gifts cannot be recorded.
RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=
# Optional: minimum reCAPTCHA score from 0.0 (bot) to 1.0 (human); default 0.5.
# RECAPTCHA_MIN_SCORE=0.5
# Optional: where gifts.json is stored. Defaults to ./data. On Cloud Run this is the mounted bucket (/data).
# DATA_DIR=./data

# --- Public settings, inlined at build time (safe to show on the website) ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHURCH_EMAIL=wlabesamis@gmail.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOAL=12000000
# reCAPTCHA v3 public site key (safe in the browser). Leave empty only if you do not need to record gifts locally.
NEXT_PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RAISED=2700000
# Payment methods: all four are always listed. GCash, Maya and Bank transfer show the value set here;
# if one is empty (or still the XXXX placeholder) donors are told to email the church for the details.
# Format for all three: "Label: value · Label: value" (separate parts with " · "). Edit the account names freely.
# GCash/Maya also accept just a number (account name then defaults to the church).
NEXT_PUBLIC_GCASH_NUMBER=GCash Number: +6309XX-XXX-XXXX · Account name: Gospel Christian Church
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAYA_NUMBER=Maya Number: +6309XX-XXX-XXXX · Account name: Gospel Christian Church
NEXT_PUBLIC_BANK_DETAILS=Bank: YOUR BANK · Account name: Gospel Christian Church · Account no.: XXXX-XXXX-XX
